{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id981111267"}, "name":{"label":"polaris0804"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-03-30T10:30:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.12.1"}, "id":{"label":"3947442749"}, "title":{"label":"Disappointed"}, "content":{"label":"This is the first time I use Klook's service but I'm too disappointed. Today I book a tour to the safari night chiang mai at 3pm. however, while waiting for the car, My child has an accident and must go to the hospital for emergency. When I was in the hospital, I called klook to transfer the pick-up time to 5.30pm.\nThe staff received the information and told me it was ok. But at 5:30, when i arrive and the appointment point, no one came to pick me up. After making a lot of calls to the operator, we had to rent our car to our place.\nNot stopped there, we have not been able to enter because there were no employees of klook delivering tickets. We had to call many times before the staff could bring the ticket.tour from 5:30 - 9:30. But klook catch us back from 8:30 am or we will have to rent the car ourselves. I'll never use klook again. 😡", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=961850126&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
